369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this module, we dive into LangChain, a framework that simplifies the creation of complex AI applications using LLMs \(Large Language Models\). You will learn how to use LangChain's components for data ingestion, document loaders, and text splitting techniques to prepare data for processing. Additionally, we cover how to work with embeddings from various sources such as OpenAI, Ollama, and Hugging Face, and integrate them with vector storage systems like FAISS and ChromaDB. By the end of this module, you'll have a deep understanding of how to structure, process, and store data within LangChain for use in AI models and agents.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
